    { nb::class_<BRepGraph_Deduplicate> cls(m, "BRepGraph_Deduplicate", R"nbdoc(@brief Deep geometry deduplication algorithm over an existing BRepGraph.

This algorithm canonicalizes deep-equal geometry references (surfaces and
3D curves) using GeomHash hashers. It updates face/edge definition links to
canonical geometry nodes and can record lineage in graph history.

First implementation intentionally does not merge edge/face definitions yet.)nbdoc");
    }
